### 6. Box Office Analysis Agent

Analyses sourced financial information.

### 7. Awards Intelligence Agent

Verifies award nominations, winners and festival selections.

### 8. Upcoming Demand Agent

Analyses measurable pre-release anticipation signals.

### 9. OTT Availability Agent

Finds country-specific streaming options.

### 10. Cinema Discovery Agent

Finds cinemas and available booking destinations for a user-selected location.

### 11. General Movie Research Agent

Handles broader movie questions and coordinates other agents where necessary.

### 12. Evidence Validation Agent

Checks source quality, conflicts, freshness and unsupported claims.

### 13. Personalisation Agent

Uses approved user preferences to improve discovery and recommendations.

